                "text": "This morning, I tested positive for COVID during a routine test.\n\nFortunately, I am fully vaccinated and boosted, and only experiencing mild symptoms. I am isolating and working remotely.\n\nI encourage everyone to get fully vaccinated, including both boosters.",
