                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "I'm excited to recognize Michael Meyers as the July Constituent of the Month. Michael is the founder of North County San Diego\u2019s first local goalball team for the blind and visually impaired. After his diagnosis of a degenerative eye disease during high school, he turned his disability into a force for local advocacy to give other visually impaired people an opportunity to play the sport. Thank you, Michael for your work to create a fun, safe and inclusive environment!",
